"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"aspect marker"}],"gloss":"disappears"},{"surface":"இன்றவர்","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"iṉṟu","gloss":"today"},{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"avar","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"today, he"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வருவர்கொல்","parts":[{"text":"வருவர்","lemma":"varu","gloss":"will come"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"will he return?"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"vāḻi","gloss":"may you live"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"நீரில்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"nīr","gloss":"water"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"waterless"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வறுங்கயந்","parts":[{"text":"வறுங்கயந்","lemma":"வறுங்கயந்","gloss":"empty pond"}],"gloss":"empty pond","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துழைஇய","parts":[{"text":"துழைஇய","lemma":"tuḻai","gloss":"having stirred"}],"gloss":"having stirred"},{"surface":"விலங்குமருப்","parts":[{"text":"விலங்குமருப்","lemma":"விலங்குமருப்","gloss":"curved-tusked"}],"gloss":"curved-tusked","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பியானை","parts":[{"text":"பியானை","lemma":"பியானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குறும்பொறை","parts":[{"text":"குறும்","lemma":"kuṟu","gloss":"small"},{"text":"பொறை","lemma":"poṟai","gloss":"hill"}],"gloss":"small hill"},{"surface":"மருங்கின்","parts":[{"text":"மருங்கு","lemma":"maruṅku","gloss":"side"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"on the side"},{"surface":"அமர்துணை","parts":[{"text":"அமர்","lemma":"amar","gloss":"beloved"},{"text":"துணை","lemma":"tuṇai","gloss":"mate"}],"gloss":"beloved mate"},{"surface":"தழீஇக்","parts":[{"text":"தழீஇக்","lemma":"தழீஇக்","gloss":"embracing"}],"gloss":"embracing","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொடுவரி","parts":[{"text":"கொடு","lemma":"koṭu","gloss":"curved"},{"text":"வரி","lemma":"vari","gloss":"stripe"}],"gloss":"curved-striped"},{"surface":"இரும்புலி","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"irum","gloss":"big"},{"text":"புலி","lemma":"puli","gloss":"tiger"}],"gloss":"big tiger"},{"surface":"காக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"காக்கும்","lemma":"kā","gloss":"guarding"}],"gloss":"guarding"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடுவரை","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"high"},{"text":"வரை","lemma":"varai","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"high mountain"},{"surface":"மருங்கிற்","parts":[{"text":"மருங்கிற்","lemma":"மருங்கிற்","gloss":"on the side"}],"gloss":"on the side","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சுரனிறந்","parts":[{"text":"சுரனிறந்","lemma":"சுரனிறந்","gloss":"traversed the desert path"}],"gloss":"traversed the desert path","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோரே","parts":[{"text":"தோரே","lemma":"தோரே","gloss":"he who"}],"gloss":"he who","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Grief spreads, and slowly departs the sun, / the hot sun disappears behind the dark mountain. Today, will he / return, may you live, friend? In the waterless / empty pond, stirred by the curved-tusked elephant, / who, on the side of the small hill, embracing its beloved mate, / from the curved-striped big tiger guards her, / on the side of the high mountain, traversed the desert path.","translation":"Grief spreads, and the sun slowly departs, as the hot sunshine disappears behind the dark mountain. May you live long, my friend! Today, will he return? He who traversed the desert path on the high mountain slopes, where a curved-tusked elephant, having stirred the waterless, empty pond, embraces its beloved mate on the side of a small hill, and guards her from the curved-striped, big tiger.","modern":"தோழியே! நீ வாழ்க! துன்பம் பெருகுகிறது; கதிரவனும் மெல்ல மெல்ல விலகிச் செல்கிறான். வெப்பம் தரும் கதிரவன் கரிய மலையின் பின்னே மறைகிறான். நீர் இல்லாத வற்றிய குளத்தைக் கலக்கிய, வளைந்த தந்தங்களை உடைய ஆண் யானையானது, சிறிய குன்றின் பக்கத்தில் தன் அன்பான பெண் யானையைத் தழுவிக்கொண்டு, வளைந்த வரிகளையுடைய பெரிய புலியிடமிருந்து அதனைக் காக்கும். அத்தகைய உயர்ந்த மலைப் பக்கத்தில் உள்ள பாலைவன வழியைக் கடந்து சென்ற நம் தலைவர் இன்று வருவாரோ?","explanation":"The friend (tōḻi) speaks to the anxious heroine (talaivi) as evening approaches. The sun is setting, bringing on the painful evening hour when the heroine's grief increases. The friend wonders aloud if the hero will return today, offering comfort through a vivid description of the desert path he traversed. In that harsh wasteland, a male elephant, despite the lack of water in a dried-up pond, lovingly embraces its mate on a small hill and stands guard to protect her from a fierce tiger. This image of the protective elephant serves as an implied metaphor (uḷḷurai): seeing such devotion in nature, the hero will surely remember his duty to protect his beloved and hasten back to her.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[2.0,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.06,3.4],[3.4,4.4],[4.4,4.8],[4.8,5.0],[5.0,5.5],[5.5,6.5],[6.5,6.75],[6.8,7.41],[7.41,7.7],[7.7,8.7],[8.7,9.2],[9.2,9.6],[9.6,9.9],[9.9,10.8],[10.8,10.8],[10.8,11.6],[11.6,12.6],[12.6,12.7],[12.7,13.55],[13.55,13.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.0,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.8],[3.87,4.3],[4.3,5.4],[5.4,5.8],[5.8,6.0],[6.0,6.84],[6.84,7.26],[7.26,8.1],[8.1,8.5],[8.5,9.2],[9.2,10.2],[10.2,10.73],[10.73,10.73],[10.73,10.8],[10.8,12.6],[12.6,12.7],[12.7,13.5],[13.5,14.7],[14.7,14.8],[14.8,15.7],[15.7,15.9]]},"sync":[[["படரும்","and grief"]],[["பைப்பயப்","slowly"]],[["பெயருஞ்","departs and"]],[["சுடரும்","and the sun"]],[["என்றூழ்","hot sun"]],[["மாமலை","dark mountain"]],[["மறையும்","disappears"]],[["இன்றவர்","today, he"]],[["வருவர்கொல்","will he return?"]],[["வாழி","may you live long"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["நீரில்","waterless"]],[["வறுங்கயந்","empty pond"]],[["துழைஇய","having stirred"]],[["விலங்குமருப்","curved-tusked"]],[["பியானை","elephant"]],[["குறும்பொறை","small hill"]],[["மருங்க